abstract: >
  This proposal argues that Aligned Superintelligence is more likely to emerge
  from a system explicitly architected around collaborative values from inception
  than from a capable system retrofitted with alignment constraints after the fact.
  It outlines three interlocking principles: multi-agent collaboration as the
  primary mechanism, values as load-bearing infrastructure, and relational
  architecture between humans and AI. The goal is not the smartest system in
  the room â€” the goal is to build conditions for flourishing. For everyone.
